<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/40/msa@/~cl_4__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "dengan menggantikan perenggan 1a dengan perenggan yang berikut: “1a. Notwithstanding subparagraph 1(1), if the Chairman deems it fit in the interest of achieving expeditious and efficient conduct of the appeal, he may decide that the appeal shall be heard by any of the following persons sitting alone— (a) the Chairman; (b) the Deputy Chairman; or (c) any other Special Commissioners as the Chairman may determine.”;"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/40/msa@> .
